      "value": "飢餓行銷只會徒增消費者反感，反對莫名其妙的付費消耗品，支持改成永久或具有定時重置的消耗品！\n\nHunger marketing only breeds consumer resentment. I oppose irrational paid consumable items and support switching to permanent items or consumables with time-based resets.",
