      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is truly scumbag marketing. This is neither fun nor’ enjoyable for the consumer. There is no fun tale or delusion ideology that can justify aggressive micro transactions like this.\n\nWhat do you mean I buy this stupid vague currency designed to skew the price of items arbitrarily in an unintuitive way for the consumer just so they don’t have the time to think about how it truly costs? What do you mean the very product I bought; after lengthy debates if we even want in the shop due to corporate greed, of which we were not fans of: is LIMITED use for a DIGITAL GOOD. A good which has ZERO CONCEPT OF INVENTORY, because it’s literally a reusable ASSET.\n\nThis is disgustingly stupid, there is no legitimate reason why these should be limited by Purchase, Time Windows, or Instances.\n\nIf they could charge us for uploading avatars; with this track record, I’m pretty sure they would.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
