      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It's clearly VRChat team is searching for ways to make money. Paid consumables is example to keep feeding bags of VRChat team while we are losing more and more money for just small things that gone poof already.\n\nIf we have subscription, you did give some free stuff to us. This is good way, also some QoL and tools are made for VRC+, no limits in use every month. So it's okay.\n\nBut limited paid consumables, gone forever after X uses, is pure money loss. As VRChat world builder, something can even FREE added to some worlds as items, and we all can enjoy it. This is huge difference between Shop items and items in some worlds. Yeah, i don't get it...\n\nAnd we know it's sort of micro transaction, makes it even more expensive.\n\nI suggest remove consumables, make them free as part of VRC+ gifts is better because it will not cost more, and maybe it will make more people will get VRC+ sub to use them unlimited every month.\n\nI am very well aware hosting VRChat is not cheap, and we all very thankfully it's still free for YEARS. Try make money is okay, but not in dirty way please. Consumables are dirty way.\n\nThank you.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
